# DCLF reading the second batch of ported producers through the graph: Screen Space Shadows (t45), LLF's local shadow cache
# (t102, t103; needs EnableLocalShadows), Grass Collision (the grass draw row), Skylighting's graph reset, IBL reading Dynamic
# Cubemaps' published cubemap, Effects11's rays reading Terrain Blending's published depth. dclf-publish2-0.env is the D3D11
# reference. Look for "[DCLF] frame texture ... reads the graph resource" (t45, t102, t103), "[DCLF] grass collision reads the
# graph resource", "[ORG] Skylighting: the probe volumes reset on the render graph", "[ORG] IBL: the environment SH reads Dynamic
# Cubemaps' published cubemap", and no "[DCLF] t<n> reads the D3D11 export" or "[ORG] frame anchors: ... already imports".
CS_ORG_SCREEN_SPACE_SHADOWS=1
CS_ORG_LLF_SHADOWS=1
CS_ORG_GRASS_COLLISION=1
CS_ORG_SKYLIGHTING=1
CS_ORG_IBL=1
CS_ORG_DYNAMIC_CUBEMAPS=1
CS_ORG_TERRAIN_BLENDING=1
CS_ORG_E11_RAYS=1
CS_ORG_EXPONENTIAL_HEIGHT_FOG=1
CS_ORG_TERRAIN_SHADOWS=1
CS_ORG_VOLUMETRIC_SHADOWS=1
CS_ORG_CLOUD_SHADOWS=1
DXVK_DEBUG=hang
VK_LOADER_LAYERS_DISABLE=*nsight*
CS_DCLF_TEST_COMMANDS=600:set timescale to 0;601:set gamehour to 13;602:fw 81a;700:coc Whiterun;2000:fw 81a;2400:dclf:shot=whiterun;2500:coc WhiterunDragonsreach;3600:dclf:shot=dragonsreach
CS_DCLF_TEST_EXIT=3700
